<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Oct 1.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Algerian press on Tuesday as reported by the official Algerian news agency APS. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL CHAAB</p>
<p>- The authorities speed up preparations for the referendum.</p>
<p>EL MOUDJAHID</p>
<p>- Delegates at the economic conference discuss banking system and companies' financing.</p>
<p>- University students resume academic year.</p>
<p>AL KHABAR</p>
<p>- Reformists attack their National Liberation Front (FLN) leader's policy, terming it inadequate to meet country's problems.</p>
<p>LE MATIN</p>
<p>- Air Algerie pilots stage strike.</p>
</text>
